l architecture evoking unease and nostalgia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd3 Narrative told through space, not exposition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 A slow, reflective horror experience with no jump scares</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echo of Humanity invites you to wander, to listen, and to feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything that\u2019s gone is truly silent.</p>","developers":["Last Save"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099740/52179d3c49b5edfe58336199a9f6de948c6346f7/header.jpg?t=1774253162","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4099740/1751267231/75f8d146f7b300a489c105ea17bdca217c5bbed8/1761223960/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761224484","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4099740/1751267231/75f8d146f7b300a489c105ea17bdca217c5bbed8/1761223960/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761224484","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4099740/1751267231/75f8d146f7b300a489c105ea17bdca217c5bbed8/1761223960/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761224484","id":257221619,"name":"Echo of Humanity Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257221619/60af0d948998aee21b26f99c92eee1f9629969fb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761224484"}],"name":"ECHO OF HUMANITY","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 / AMD Radeon RX 570 (4 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available s